("mephedrone","plateau",0,"Many describe a 'wired but empty' body: buzzing nerves, a dry, sore nose and tight muscles in the neck and back."),
("mephedrone","comedown",0,"Appetite returns slowly, and the nose and throat may be raw for days if it was snorted."),
("mephedrone","comedown",1,"People often describe feeling emotionally hollowed out, as if the warmth of the night has been repaid with interest."),
